cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Argentina Economic Monitor, please cite it as below. For the
  underlying statistics, cite the original source of each series (INDEC, BCRA,
  Ministry of Economy and others), named on every chart.
title: "Argentina Economic Monitor"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English and Spanish) site of Argentina's official economic
  statistics, updated twice a day from the publishers' own files, checked
  against the stored history before publication, and kept with its full
  revision history. Includes constructed series such as a long-run CPI
  spliced across bases and long-run GDP chain-linked across bases.
type: software
